# Verify All Authority Dashboard Navigation Buttons
1. Open http://localhost:3001/authority-login.html
2. Click on the "Sign In" or "Create an Account" button.
3. Fill out the registration form with dummy data: Name "Test User", Email "test@apsdma.gov.in", Phone "1234567890", ID "TEST-001", and passcode "Authority@2026".
4. Select any option for Department and Jurisdiction.
5. Click "Create Account & Continue".
6. Wait for the Authority Dashboard to load.
7. Click on the "Population at Risk" tab in the left sidebar.
8. Click on the "Safe Sites & Capacity" tab in the left sidebar.
9. Click on the "Verification Queue" tab in the left sidebar.
10. Click on the "Broadcast Alert" button in the top right corner.
11. Verify that the "Broadcast Emergency Alert" modal is visible.
12. Click the "Cancel" button inside the modal to close it.
13. Click on the "Zone Manager" tab in the left sidebar.
14. Click on the "Map View" tab in the left sidebar.
